WEBVTT

NOTE CineReels — prov-dramabox-42000021392 — Episode 58 — English subtitles
NOTE Transcribed 2026-11-27 from the real episode audio (faster-whisper small).

1
00:00:05.490 --> 00:00:08.190
It's all choked with dark magic down there.

2
00:00:08.190 --> 00:00:10.390
The elements won't answer to us.

3
00:00:10.390 --> 00:00:20.140
We can't risk charging in blind.

4
00:00:20.140 --> 00:00:23.540
Does it feel like home, Aris?

5
00:00:23.540 --> 00:00:26.540
This is where your nightmare began.

6
00:00:26.540 --> 00:00:28.340
Twenty years ago.

7
00:00:28.340 --> 00:00:30.540
I'm not that helpless baby anymore.

8
00:00:30.540 --> 00:00:34.040
Today, every one of you pay for what you've done.

9
00:00:34.040 --> 00:00:37.500
No!

10
00:00:37.500 --> 00:00:41.100
That mutated bat actually grew into a sovereign?

11
00:00:41.100 --> 00:00:42.300
Impossible!

12
00:00:42.400 --> 00:00:44.700
A sovereign bonding with a floor-sweeber?

13
00:00:44.700 --> 00:00:47.000
Another parlor trick!

14
00:00:47.000 --> 00:00:48.400
Just kill Seraphina.

15
00:00:48.400 --> 00:00:53.780
He's nothing without her.

16
00:00:53.780 --> 00:00:56.980
I already put down your blue lizard.

17
00:00:56.980 --> 00:01:00.380
And you still have the garn to keep running that mouth?

18
00:01:00.380 --> 00:01:01.780
Lucian!

19
00:01:01.780 --> 00:01:04.480
Are you gonna let her insult me like this?

20
00:01:04.480 --> 00:01:05.980
Stop.

21
00:01:05.980 --> 00:01:07.880
You are no match for her.

22
00:01:07.880 --> 00:01:09.180
Kill Aris!

23
00:01:09.180 --> 00:01:10.580
Bring me Seraphina!

24
00:01:10.580 --> 00:01:13.280
Alive!

25
00:01:13.280 --> 00:01:15.880
He is like a starving dog.

26
00:01:15.880 --> 00:01:19.380
Wagging his tail at any hand that holds a scrap of favor.

27
00:01:19.380 --> 00:01:20.980
Aris! Now!

28
00:01:20.980 --> 00:01:22.480
Reach for your dragon's mind!

29
00:01:22.480 --> 00:01:23.980
Pull the elements through him!
